    <p>Stable page identifiers follow source scan filenames, not a reconciled manuscript foliation. Visible written numbers differ at several checked leaves (for example scan87r bears88, scan164r bears165). A +1 shift after the uncut83/84 bifolium is a working inference, not an exhaustively verified renumbering. Catalogue msDesc is preserved separately; see ../foliation-review.json. No source file is renamed.</p></encodingDesc>
